Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Directory Topology Projection

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a zero-effect transform that consumes one complete supplied stability input, reruns current stability reconciliation, validates strict caller placement, and releases one lineage-preserving wrapper around a current-M2A-valid directory form without claiming physical, traversal, inventory, receipt, or admission provenance.

