& [PlacementPlanContract] is strict and bounded
  + [type] WindowsSuppliedDirectoryTopologyProjectionPlan
  + [profile] exactly cantor-windows-supplied-directory-topology-projection/0.1
  + [projection_identity] nonzero caller-owned u64
  + [entry_reference_identity] nonzero caller-owned u64
  + [relative_path] required String later validated as an M2A descendant path
  + [observation_ordinal] nonzero caller-owned u64
  + [encoded_plan_cap] exactly 262144 bytes before JSON decode
  + serde denies unknown fields, omissions, wrong types, and malformed values
  - never: expose a plan mode, length, digest, metadata, stable pair, seed, root, handle, clock, or provenance assertion

& [LowerInputContract] requires current revalidation
  + [accepted_input] exactly WindowsSuppliedEntryStabilityInput by value
  + [mandatory_operation] reconcile_windows_supplied_entry_stability
  + [successful_carrier] the returned current WindowsSuppliedEntryStablePair is retained completely
  + [lower_failure] exact WindowsSuppliedEntryStabilityFault is boxed and nested under stability
  - never: accept WindowsSuppliedEntryStablePair directly
  - never: accept a bare supplied observation, projection seed, topology observation, digest, or serialized projection wrapper

& [EvaluationContract] is canonical order
  + validate plan
  + reconcile complete stability input under current authority
  + require exact plan-to-pair entry-reference equality
  + derive the pre-read topology projection seed
  + require exact Directory kind
  + map one candidate using the closed mapping
  + invoke current ValidateTopologyForm
  + extract the final component from the validated descendant path
  + require exact final-component-to-policy-component equality
  + release one complete output-only wrapper
  = must: terminate at the first fault and release no partial success

& [DirectoryProjectionContract] is closed
  + [relative_path] Some exact plan value
  + [kind] exact seed Directory
  + [mode_class] fixed TopologyModeClass Directory
  + [attributes] exact seed value
  + [identity] exact seed value
  + [number_of_links] exact seed value
  + [streams] exact seed vector
  + [length] None
  + [content_sha256] None
  + [observation_ordinal] exact plan value
  + no default, case fold, Unicode normalization, path normalization, filesystem lookup, or invented value is permitted
  - never: project RootDirectory or RegularFile
  - never: synthesize zero length or an empty-content digest

& [EntryReferenceContract] is exact
  + plan reference is checked nonzero before lower processing
  + successful stable-pair reference is established by current lower validation
  + values must compare equal under exact u64 equality
  + mismatch returns entry_reference before candidate construction
  - never: interpret equality as physical object, handle, path, time, or cryptographic identity

& [TopologyValidationContract] is current
  + candidate must invoke its current ValidateTopologyForm implementation
  + every current identity, link, stream, descendant-path, directory-mode, absent-length, absent-digest, and ordinal rule remains authoritative
  + exact TopologyFormFault is boxed and nested only under topology_form
  - never: duplicate a weaker path or topology validator

& [ComponentContract] is exact and post-validation
  + final component is obtained only after current M2A accepts the descendant path
  + one-component paths use the whole validated path
  + multi-component paths use the substring after the final forward slash
  + final component equals stable pre-read policy component by exact String equality
  + mismatch returns component
  - never: infer physical path existence, resolution, root membership, or traversal

& [OutputContract] prevents forged success
  + [type] WindowsSuppliedDirectoryTopologyProjection
  + fields are private and preserve exact profile, plan, stable pair, and topology observation
  + derives Clone, Debug, PartialEq, Eq, and Serialize only
  + exposes immutable reference getters only
  + has no Deserialize, Default, public constructor, public fields, mutable getters, From, or Into
  + serialized output is inspectable evidence and not a trusted reconstruction format

& [FaultContract] is closed, bounded, and atomic
  + [codes] json, profile, projection_identity, entry_reference_identity, stability, entry_reference, kind, topology_form, component, ordinal, and resource
  + [nested_stability_fault] Some only for stability
  + [nested_topology_fault] Some only for topology_form
  + [field_cap] 64 Unicode scalar values
  + [message_cap] 256 Unicode scalar values
  + [atomicity] no fault contains or accompanies successful projection state

& [EvidenceGradeContract] is non-inflating
  + [supplied] lower records and placement syntax originate with caller
  + [revalidated] current pure assembly and stability rules executed in this call
  + [derived] seed fields are exact deterministic transforms
  + [declared] path, ordinal, projection identity, and plan reference remain caller syntax
  + [correlated] exact structural reference and component equality passed
  + [projected] current M2A structural validation passed
  + [physical_enumerated_inventory_complete_admitted] are absent

& [SemanticBoundary] is mandatory
  - never: claim supplied inputs came from Windows, a filesystem, one directory handle, or one physical object
  - never: claim actual pre-post time order, handle continuity, freshness, or same epoch
  - never: claim path existence, root membership, enumeration, traversal order, directory-stream completeness, canonical inventory order, duplicate freedom, aggregate digest, Git truth, receipt, admission, or mutation safety
  - never: authorize filesystem, process, network, model, persistence, mutation, sealing, test execution, cleanup, or promotion effects

& [ImplementationBoundary] is zero effect
  + [authorized_file] crates/cantor_ecosystem/src/windows_supplied_directory_topology_projection.rs
  + [authorized_export] one exact library module export
  + [authorized_tests] module unit tests, one independent static test, one evidence rehash test, and workspace regression
  + [plan_json_byte_cap] 262144
  + [message_scalar_cap] 256
  + [field_scalar_cap] 64
  + [Cargo_delta] zero
  + [lockfile_delta] zero
  + [unsafe] denied
  + [production_imports] std formatting, serde, topology forms, supplied observation seed support, and supplied stability support
  - never: use windows-sys, filesystem, path resolution, process, environment, clock, random, network, persistence, database, model, handle, pointer, buffer, platform query, Git, traversal, inventory, receipt, admission, mutation, seal, cleanup, review execution, or promotion APIs

& [RequirementSet] is M2B-SDTP-001 through M2B-SDTP-013
  + strict plan, stability-input-only input, current lower revalidation, exact reference join, directory shape, exact mapping, current M2A validation, exact component join, output-only wrapper, bounded atomic faults, semantic nonclaims, zero effects, and proof closure

