  + source manifest matches exact SHA-256 and bytes
  + governing signature binds every SJS stage and both prerequisite signatures
  + module unit and independent static tests pass in debug and overflow-checked release
  + every requirement, mapping edge, gate, fault, bound, and output rule has a direct test or static proof edge
