  + clone-portable evidence hashes canonical, module, tests, solution, proof-support, review, and narrative artifacts
  + workspace tests, format, warnings-denied lint, release build, warnings-denied docs, audit, and recursive evidence closure pass
  + root, inventory, physical producer, Git, traversal, receipt, and admission remain absent

